# Case of the Ransacked Lab (cast on turn 1 with Black Lotus's {U}{U}{U}): on turn 3 Bot1 casts three Mutagenic Growths (instants, 2 life each) and Gitaxian Probe (a sorcery, 2 life) -
# four instant and sorcery spells this turn, so "To solve" holds at the end step and it becomes solved (CR 719.3a); the spells cast while it was unsolved drew nothing. On turn 5, with only
